      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Transform image 1 into an epic fantasy adventure-cover painting of a {common_name} ({scientific_name}) from {place}. The bird is the central character in a grand wilderness quest: a real creature presented with the presence and dignity of a legendary encounter.\n\nPaint in richly layered, opaque gouache with sculpted brush strokes, bold masses of light and shadow, selective fine feather detail, and a tactile, hand-painted surface. Use the visual language of classic tabletop fantasy campaign art: luminous focal light, deep atmospheric shadows, rich pigments, and an ancient, mysterious world. The image must unmistakably read as a painting.\n\nPreserve the bird from image 1: its anatomy, proportions, pose, silhouette, plumage colours, and diagnostic field marks. Preserve its sex and age characteristics. A dull female or juvenile remains dull; lighting must not invent brighter plumage or new markings. Keep the eye, bill, and wing tips unobstructed.\n\nBuild a new, immersive background using {edition_motifs}. Arrange these elements as dramatic environmental framing, giving the scene depth and a sense of discovery while keeping the bird dominant. Apply {edition_colors} primarily to the environment and atmospheric shadows. Illuminate the scene with {edition_light}. {light}\n\nCreate wonder through composition, paint, atmosphere, and light. The bird remains entirely natural: no armour, clothing, jewellery, magical anatomy, or invented plumage.\n\nPaint edge to edge. No typography, letters, borders, frames, logos, or watermarks."
      ],
      "title": "prompt template",
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
